msgctxt "64"
msgid "Know any clubs with cute girls?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I'm not too familiar with hostess clubs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"It doesn't have to be a hostess club. Any place with cute girls is fine. "
"Just watching them is super relaxing, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Well, what about that bar Serena on Tenkaichi Street? The owner there's a "
"total knockout!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Serena? Didn't that place close down after its owner was killed on account "
"of some yakuza trouble?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Yeah, but it recently got a new owner. They're calling it \"New Serena\" "
"now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Really? I had no idea. All right, then. Let's go see this \"knockout\" of "
"yours!"
msgstr ""

